
This directory generates I/O routines which used to be in stdio and gen.
Since the source codes are exactly the same as those in /usr/src/lib/libc/stdio
and /usr/src/lib/libc/gen, they are not listed here.  Users should make symbolic
links to the sources before running the Makefile.  An exception is strcmpfold.c
which is listed here since it's not standard.

Note:  The LIB and BIN given in ./Makefile should be the same as in ../Makefile
and ../sys/Makefile.

